            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Needed cookies:</strong> These make the site work. They keep your basket, checkout, and security in place. The shop cannot run without them.</li><li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> These help us see how people use the site so we can improve it. We only use these if you agree.</li><li><strong>Choice cookies:</strong> These remember things like your language or last visit. We only use these if you agree.</li></ul>"
